{"c":[{"id":"d32f644355f794d8","sum":"B24: a fill asks whose first, then values: 4 Jev calls (tests use PER_FILL); space Groq writer calls 30 s; sandboxed TextEdit opens a command-line file only from ~/Library/Containers/com.apple.TextEdit/Data/tmp.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T192504Z-05aef102d22989aa","text":"B24: fill asks in two stages when a field takes a person's details (whose first, then values), so a fill is 4 Jev calls, not 2; tests that count calls use PER_FILL. Groq's qwen3.8 hits 429 token limits within ~20 plans; space writer calls 30 s.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T192504Z-2947a2d88b908a7e","text":"B24: TextEdit is sandboxed: a file named on its command line opens only from inside ~/Library/Containers/com.apple.TextEdit/Data/tmp (realfill-capture.ts makes its own folder there and deletes it).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"712d8e92089c7858","sum":"B24/I2: Chrome AX shows a native select as AXPopUpButton holding only its chosen option, so fill hands selects off; page-link toWindowSnapshot mirrors Chrome AX (AXTimeField; radios in an AXGroup per name; options as AXMenuItem).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T192504Z-d09a0e8b1bd722e1","text":"B24: Chrome's AX shows a native <select> as AXPopUpButton whose only child is the selected option; the option list is not readable without opening it, so fill names selects as hand-offs with no value (capture-2 probe).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T195842Z-c30fb40a821e024f","text":"I2: page-link.ts toWindowSnapshot must match Chrome AX for fill/controls.ts: time is AXTimeField, radios sit under an AXGroup per name attribute, select options are AXMenuItem children. PageControl has no fieldset legend, so page radio groups have no label.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
